obj_id: agentGenerated_SouthRegionTotalSalesAnalysis-cd4576cc
liveboard:
  name: agentGenerated_South Region Total Sales Analysis
  visualizations:
  - id: Viz_1
    viz_guid: c29e4504-a6d9-4034-aed8-d8d2a1922b9b
    note_tile:
      html_parsed_string: |-
        Key Drivers:
        • South region ranks 4th in sales with 46% less revenue than top-performing West region
        • Tables and Machines sub-categories are losing money with -10.5% and -2.7% profit margins respectively
        • 2024 shows collapsing profitability: despite 31% sales growth, profit dropped 50% and margin fell to 7.2%
        • Excessive discounting in loss-making categories: Tables (22.3%) and Machines (33.3%) average discounts

        Recommendations:
        • Immediately review pricing strategy for Tables and Machines or consider discontinuing in South region
        • Implement discount controls, especially for categories with margins below 10%
        • Analyze 2024 cost structure changes driving profit margin collapse from 18.9% to 7.2%
